stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: issue labeled + assigned
    pending --> claimed: runner takes it
    claimed --> working
    working --> retrying: attempt failed
    retrying --> claimed: delivered again
    working --> gate_failed: gate fails or times out
    working --> failed: attempts used up,<br/>bad config, or no linear stack
    working --> reviewing: pull request opened
    reviewing --> pr_opened: review passed,<br/>merge left to a person
    reviewing --> review_failed: changes requested,<br/>rounds used up
    reviewing --> merged: factory merge
    reviewing --> merge_failed: could not merge
    gate_failed --> pending: remove + re-add<br/>schmeide:ready
    failed --> pending: remove + re-add<br/>schmeide:ready
    pr_opened --> [*]
    merged --> [*]
    review_failed --> [*]
    merge_failed --> [*]
